Sureshwari IT Park in Borivali West Mumbai\n\n![Thakur Sureshwari IT Park, Mumbai - 4 BHK Villa](https://dynamic.realestateindia.com/proj_images/wh4/project18631/proj_header_image-18631.jpg)\n\n# Thakur Sureshwari IT Park\n\nBorivali West, Mumbai\n\n4 BHK Independent House\n\n* [Overview](#pdOverview)\n* [Unit Configuration](#pdPriceRange)\n* [Amenities](#pdAminities)\n* [Gallery](#projectGallery)\n* [Location Map](#pdLocationMap)\n* [About Builder](#pdAboutBuilderProject)\n\nThakur Sureshwari IT Park Independent House\n\n* ![](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/mobile-images/pf-img1.jpg)\n\n  Property Type  \n\n  Independent House\n* ![](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/mobile-images/pf-img2.jpg)\n\n  Configuration  \n\n  4 BHK\n* ![](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/mobile-images/pf-img13.jpg)\n\n  Area of Independent House  \n\n  4500 Sq.ft.\n* ![](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/mobile-images/pf-img4.jpg)\n\n  Possession  \n\n  Aug 2013\n* ![](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/mobile-images/pf-img5.jpg)\n\n  Total Units  \n\n  25 units\n* ![](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/mobile-images/pf-img8.jpg)\n\n  Launch Date  \n\n  Dec 2011\n* ![](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/mobile-images/pf-img9.jpg)\n\n  Possession Status  \n\n  Ready to Move\n\n## Unit Configuration\n\n| Unit Type | Area | Price (in ) | Floor Plan |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| 4 BHK +4T | 4500 Sq.ft. (Built Up) | Call for Price |  |\n\n## About Thakur Sureshwari IT Park\n\nThakur Sureshwari IT Park by Thakur Group at Borivali West, Andheri to Dahisar Mumbai. It offers 4 BHK residential villa area ranging sq.ft. with price per sq.ft. from 12280-17778. The project offers [...read more](javascript:void(0);)\n\n### About Thakur Sureshwari IT Park\n\nAbout Thakur Sureshwari IT Park\n\nThakur Sureshwari IT Park by Thakur Group at Borivali West, Andheri to Dahisar Mumbai. It offers 4 BHK residential villa area ranging sq.ft. with price per sq.ft. from 12280-17778. The project offers world class residential units with top line specifications. The project enables easy connectivity to all points of interest in and around city.  \n  \nThakur Sureshwari IT Park villa are located at an excellent locality of Andheri to Dahisar Mumbai. which is much far from the hasty tones and fuzziness of the city. With bizarre hi-tech specifications of quality construction and architectural designs, you can be sure of loving the place where you would see your bright future.  \n  \nThe facilities provided are top of the line matching your desire for a perfect home as which invite you to discover an exquisitely sublime world of refined indulgences for the rare few who have carved their own niche in the upper echelons of society.\n\n## Amenities\n\n* ![Kids Play Area](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/mobile-images/aminities/kids-play-area.jpg)\n\n  Kids Play Area\n* ![Piped Gas](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/mobile-images/aminities/piped-gas.png)\n\n  Piped Gas\n* ![RO Water System](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/mobile-images/aminities/ro-water-system.jpg)\n\n  RO Water System\n* ![Security](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/mobile-images/aminities/security.jpg)\n\n  Security\n* ![Vastu](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/mobile-images/aminities/vastu.jpg)\n\n  Vastu\n\n## Image Gallery of this Project\n\n![](https://dynamic.realestateindia.com/proj_images/wh3/project18631/proj_header_image-18631.jpg)\n\n## Location Map of Thakur Sureshwari IT Park\n\n## Approved by Banks\n\n* ![Axis Bank](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/mobile-images/bank/axis_bank.jpg)\n* ![HDFC Housing Finance](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/mobile-images/bank/hdfc_housing_finance.jpg)\n* ![ICICI Bank](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/mobile-images/bank/icici_bank.jpg)\n* ![State Bank of India](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/mobile-images/bank/state_bank_of_india.jpg)\n* ![Union Bank of India](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/mobile-images/bank/union_bank_of_india.jpg)\n* ![PNB Housing](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/mobile-images/bank/pnb_housing.jpg)\n* ![India Bulls Home Loans](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/mobile-images/bank/india_bulls_home_loans.jpg)\n* ![DHFL](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/mobile-images/bank/dhfl.jpg)\n* ![TATA CAPITAL](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/mobile-images/bank/tata_capital.jpg)\n* ![Kotak Mahindra Bank](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/mobile-images/bank/kotak_mahindra_bank.jpg)\n* ![HFFC](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/mobile-images/bank/hffc.jpg)\n\n[+8 more](javascript:void();)\n\n[Calculate EMI](javascript:popup_emi_calculator();)\n\n## About Thakur Group of Companies\n\nThakur Group Can Rightfully Claim the Credit of Developing An Entire Township, Known as “thakur Complex” and “thakur Village” At Kandivali East, On Both Side of Western Express Highway, Then  [...Read more](javascript:void(0);)\n\n### About Thakur Group of Companies\n\nAbout Thakur Group of Companies\n\nThakur Group Can Rightfully Claim the Credit of Developing An Entire Township, Known as “thakur Complex” and “thakur Village” At Kandivali East, On Both Side of Western Express Highway, Then – a Sleepy Suburb and Now a Prominent Suburb of Mumbai. this Township is Fully Developed with Excellent Urban Facilities like Commercial Complexes, Cinema Houses, Bus Depot, Post Office, Public Parks, Sports Facilities, Schools, Colleges, Hospitals, Fire-brigade Station, Police Station, Banks.\n\nThakur House, Ashok Nagar,Kandivali (E),, Kandivali East, Mumbai, Maharashtra\n\n![](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/images/lazy-load-image.jpg)\n\n## Other Projects of this Builder\n\n![](https://dynamic.realestateindia.com/proj_images/project5206/proj_img-5206_1-350x350.jpg)\n\nThakur Jewel\n\n[3/4 BHK Residential Apartments](https://www.realestateindia.com/projects/thakur-jewel-by-thakur-group-of-companies-in-mumbai/)\n\nThakur Vil